This project is a Rust translation of Noah-OWP-Modular
(https://github.com/NOAA-OWP/noah-owp-modular), pinned at commit 0242a96, which
is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in
licenses/noah-owp-modular-Apache-2.0.txt.

The files under noahowp/src/ and noahowp-bmi/src/ are translated from the
Fortran sources of Noah-OWP-Modular; each ported function names the upstream
file and subroutine it was translated from. The following are verbatim copies
of upstream files, unmodified:

  noahowp/tests/fixtures/MPTABLE.TBL     (parameters/MPTABLE.TBL)
  noahowp/tests/fixtures/SOILPARM.TBL    (parameters/SOILPARM.TBL)
  noahowp/tests/fixtures/GENPARM.TBL     (parameters/GENPARM.TBL)
  noahowp/tests/fixtures/namelist.input  (run/namelist.input)

Noah-OWP-Modular was itself developed from the Noah-MP land surface model
(https://github.com/NCAR/noahmp).

Noah-OWP-Modular is a scientific product of NOAA's Office of Water Prediction.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by NOAA, the National Weather
Service or NCAR.
